  "heading": "Provision relating to parole.",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 168,
  "text": "[1][163A. Provision relating to parole.--Where any person is tried under the provisions of this Act, the Central Government or the chief of the Naval Staff or the Flag Officers commanding-in-Chief of the Naval Commands may in the case of conviction either with or without conditions release the person on parole.]",
